    <p class="content-note">Those are single-GB, short-validity rates. Nomad's Global-EX bundles price by the GB differently (as low as roughly $2.58/GB before any code on the largest sizes), so for a long-term stay, run the math on the specific bundle size and length rather than comparing the row above directly.</p>
  </div>

